Package: a5view
Title: Visualise A5 Geospatial Cells
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hugh", "Graham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hugh@belian.earth"),
    person("belian.earth", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Draws 'A5' geospatial index cells, as created by 'a5R', as
    static plots and interactive maps. geom_a5() adds cells to 'ggplot2'
    plots in any coord_sf() projection, switching to a raster at the
    output resolution for large cell sets. a5_view() is an
    'htmlwidgets' map that renders cells with 'deck.gl' over a 'MapLibre'
    basemap ('OpenFreeMap' vector tiles, no API key), with colour mapping
    and a legend, tooltips, a globe projection, 'Shiny' bindings and
    precomputed level-of-detail pyramids for large datasets.
